<span style="text-align: center;">*The Jade Marshal*</span>

<span style="color: #aba133">**Wu Peifu's Army**</span>: [+ bei_strength +] thousand

Hengyang: [? if nra_winhengyang = 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">UNCONQUERED</span> ?][? if nra_winhengyang = 1 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">CONQUERED</span> ?]

Changsha: [? if nra_winchangsha = 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">UNCONQUERED</span> ?][? if nra_winchangsha = 1 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">CONQUERED</span> ?]

Yuezhou: [? if nra_winyuezhou = 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">UNCONQUERED</span> ?][? if nra_winyuezhou = 1 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">CONQUERED</span> ?]

**Wuchang**: [? if nra_winwuchang = 0 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">UNCONQUERED</span> ?][? if nra_winwuchang = 1 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">CONQUERED</span> ?]

Wu Peifu, the Zhili warlord, protege of Cao Kun, sits at his throne in Wuchang. 
If we topple him there, we can seize the provinces of Hunan and Hubei and unify the municipalities of Hankou, Wuchang and Hanyang into the city of Wuhan.
Such a metropolis would be powerful to take hold of, and would be a major jumping-off point for campaigns into Nanjing, Beijing and Sichuan due to it's central position.

- @hengyang: March north into Hengyang.
- @changsha: March north into Changsha.
- @yuezhou: March north to Yuezhou.
- @wuchang: Cross the Yangtze and seize Wuchang!

